25,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It seems sitting together really helps the new members learn the ropes and makes handovers so much smoother.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The current plan is unfair regarding window light, and arrival times vary so much that a first-come system would be biased.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We are billed for the area regardless of people, and re-running power for every change is actually quite expensive.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Setting up every morning takes a lot of time, and those unplanned shuffles last year were a total mess!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The noise is much higher by the printer, and it takes days of tweaking to get a workstation physically comfortable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, if the window light is a problem, how can we make it fair for everyone?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"That is the difficulty. If we don't have a system, the same people always end up in the worst spots.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Mio, if shuffles are disruptive, maybe we should avoid any plan that requires frequent moving?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, that makes sense! I don't want to waste my gaps between meetings just plugging in cables.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, the physical toll of a bad seat is real. We can't just ignore the noise and the ergonomics.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Shunichi. We need to balance the social benefits of sitting together with individual comfort.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we want fairness, we have to be explicit about who sits where, or rotate the burden.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the budget. If every move costs thousands of yen, we should be very careful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But if we stay in one spot and it's a ""bad"" spot, that's also a waste of our energy!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. A permanent bad seat is a nightmare for the back and the ears.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
