50,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B keeps us grouped by function, which might help the collaboration I found in the reports.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A is out because of the arrival time bias. Option C rotates the ""bad"" seats fairly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option B is the cheapest since it avoids the re-running power costs associated with Option C.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A sounds like a nightmare with the morning setup time. I can't do that every day!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A is impossible for my back. Option C is okay, but B is more stable for ergonomics.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, is the cost difference between B and C really that significant for our budget?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, it's not just the money, but the fairness of the window seats and the noise.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,It's a few thousand yen per desk every time we shift. It adds up quickly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, if we do Option B, do we still have to deal with those messy shuffles?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Only if the function changes. Otherwise, we set it once and leave it alone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I think Option B is a lovely compromise. We stay together but keep our stability.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I prefer Option C because it guarantees no one is stuck by the printer forever.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for B. It's the safest for the budget and the least disruptive.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm with Daisuke. No daily setup and no frequent shuffles. Option B!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll go with B. Stability for my chair and my ears is the priority.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I'm voting for B as well.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll stick with C for the sake of absolute fairness.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
